  <li><strong>The "Frankenstein" Tech Stack:</strong> To make a generic portal work with your business, you end up using third-party connectors, Zapier workarounds, and messy iFrame embeds. One tiny API change from any of those tools, and your entire client-facing portal breaks without you noticing.</li>
